{"id":65920,"name":"JB Smoove","photo":"/x3bMhniW5Ncz4hEswcnGWefx4h.jpg"},{"id":77896,"name":"Bill Bellamy","photo":"/xdIgRidqBVkzmpoKYTak5HO0JTd.jpg"},{"id":13023,"name":"Colleen Camp","photo":"/t1IbM9x1vJOzg02tQr68x9F4gI3.jpg"}],"genres":["Komödie"],"id":943818,"original":"Back on the Strip","overview":"Nachdem er die Frau seiner Träume verloren hat, zieht Merlin (Spence Moore II) nach Las Vegas, um dort als Magier zu arbeiten, nur um als Frontmann für eine Wiederbelebung der berüchtigten Schwarzen männlichen Stripper-Crew „The Chocolate Chips“ engagiert zu werden. Angeführt von Luther (Wesley Snipes) - inzwischen pleite und gebrochen - legen die alten, häuslichen, unförmigen Chips frühere Konflikte beiseite und schließen sich wieder zusammen, um das Hotel zu retten, in dem sie früher aufgetreten sind, während sie Merlin helfen, sein Mädchen zurückzugewinnen.","poster":"/wy6FIXGqaOiNeBOkVei3hOB6sVM.jpg","runtime":112.0,"title":"Back on the Strip","type":"movie","va":5.6,"vc":37,"year":"2023"},"movie:944024":{"cast":[{"id":2192654,"name":"Andrea Figliomeni","photo":"/eX8QQOYhP3NcYsPjP8I7f429slT.jpg"},{"id":3447385,"name":"Winter Andrews","photo":"/eJHu9h3tb9GFjKlCBKfgXjvEvJw.jpg"},{"id":94441,"name":"Nicolette Hart","photo":"/Ak5WqYybrQaIRJIsWbLHGNrZM3p.jpg"},{"id":3379229,"name":"Emma Jessop","photo":"/y0PX4n4XBL4XYLJpRkIFFIFifrb.jpg"},{"id":2025310,"name":"Tyler Aser","photo":"/oefipYXaMWNKZe9wqD7AbtNThxg.jpg"}],"genres":["Drama"],"id":944024,"original":"The Mystery of Her","overview":"","poster":"/2C7reRuXqAgjGdfjqY7Mq6hmHlk.jpg","runtime":109.0,"title":"The Mystery of Her","type":"movie","va":6.6,"vc":33,"year":"2022"},"movie:956603":{"cast":[],"genres":["Dokumentarfilm"],"id":956603,"original":"Favorite Daughter","overview":"","poster":"/sDMZIuLWIY9leyMBZPDnLL1OaB8.jpg","runtime":19.0,"title":"Favorite Daughter","type":"movie","va":8.0,"vc":1,"year":"2022"},"tv:34839":{"cast":[{"id":124484,"name":"Keiko Han","photo":"/7fi4oxXVJJJnyZMwcud1Yzq8Re0.jpg"},{"id":57